          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Dela Keshar",
            text: _("I finally found you, Malin! At last, you’ll pay fer what you’ve done to my people and my home. I won’t let you live ta see another sunset."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Malin Keshar",
            text: _("... I suppose you did vow to kill me..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Dela Keshar",
            text: _("You didn’t think I’d keep my word? You thought I’d forgive you fer killing Drogan and tearing apart our town? You don’t know how badly I want ta kill ya, Malin."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Malin Keshar",
            text: _("..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Dela Keshar",
            text: _("Nothing to say this time? No quip ’bout how we don’t understand ya? No comment about yer moral superiority? I can only hope you’ll be so quiet when I kill you."),
          },
