            speaker: "Telemon",
            text: _("Foul necromancer! Your time has come!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Malin Keshar",
            text: _("Reinforcements! I took too long to retrieve that book and now I have no way to win this battle..."),
