          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Malin Keshar",
            text: _("The terrain is hazardous in these mountains. No one will be able to pursue me."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Malin Keshar",
            text: _("... then again, is there a point? Even should I escape, then what? All that I have fought for, everyone who I have tried to protect, everything is gone to me."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Malin Keshar",
            text: _("Life, death... unlife — at this point, I could accept any of them and nothing would change."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Malin Keshar",
            text: _("... but, I suppose giving up now would be a waste..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "win",
